With the aim of:
- Identify needs for capacity;
- Monitoring the execution of the service centers guarantee policy;
- Conducting the treatment history of the service centers;
- Marketing research in the field of sales, service and after-sales service;
- Notices me directions, information messages, advertising materials.

The list of personal data, the processing of which the consent is given by:
